<title>USA: ESCO says to buy back up to 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>ESCO says to buy back up to 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESCO Electronics Corp said it plans to purchase up to two million shares of its common stock trust receipts, each worth one share of common stock, over the next two years.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will be used for stock option, stock purchase and other employee benefit plans and for general corporate purposes, or they will be cancelled.</p>
<p>There are about 11.9 million trust receipts outstanding.</p>
<p>ESCO makes defense and commercial products.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
